1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,380
But add a peroxide, and hydrogen bromide adds the other way, giving one bromopropane.

2
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:09,375
This is the Kharasch or peroxide effect.

3
00:00:09,375 --> 00:00:15,533
It works only for hydrogen bromide, because the mechanism switches to free radicals.

